      "importance": 76,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该研究发表于顶级期刊《自然》，表明AMIE在复杂疾病管理方面与初级保健医生相当，具有重要的临床意义和行业影响。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "Published in the top journal Nature, the study shows AMIE matches primary care physicians in complex disease management, with significant clinical and industry impact.",
